I can't wait to go to Europe, but at the same time I'm terrified.

11
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:40,420
Why?

12
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,640
Well, I have aerophobia.

13
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,900
I have a chronic fear of flying.

14
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:46,420
Oh really?

15
00:00:47,360 --> 00:00:50,480
