00:06:21,540 --> 00:06:28,740
So in the beginning of today's dialogue, the character said, I cannot wait to go to Europe, but at the same time, I'm terrified.

107
00:06:29,200 --> 00:06:30,400
So at the same time.

108
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:36,090
So in this case, we're saying that we are happy, but also we are scared.

109
00:06:36,370 --> 00:06:38,830
So two things at once at the same time.

110
00:06:39,170 --> 00:06:39,350
